### Other traffic

Pcap also contains IPv6 neighbor solicitation, multicast listener reports,
and mDNS (5353) traffic from the host. These are host-side background traffic
and do not affect the ARP/ICMP verification.

## Verification

- ARP: PASS (request + reply captured, MAC matches eth0)
- ICMP echo reply: PASS (6/6 matching request/reply pairs)
- No raw ICMP socket syscall: PASS (handled by smoltcp auto-icmp-echo-reply feature)
- Transport: TAP (layer-2, no hostfwd needed for ARP/ICMP)
